    "body": "This `<my-button>` example is interesting in that it aligns with a request from @keithamus to see example of common library elements that would work in a non-JS environment. As part of the progressive enhancement story here, what sort of JS capabilities would you see `<my-button>` adding in this case? He and I were specifically discussing where and if Declarative Custom Elements would be beneficial without needing at some point crossing into a JS context. This may (or may not) be one of the case points to take into account here.",
